// Greatest labeled margin that appears on exactly one kept pair.
// No pair returns nothing. One margin returns that margin.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE mupper ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE rank  ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG mupper rank

IMPULSE mupper 1
IMPULSE rank 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY rank
DECIDE rank
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "mupper" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
